# DHCPv4 relay agent information mapping: option 82 circuit-id to a fixed
# address. The exerciser plays the relay and stamps this circuit-id onto one
# of its relayed DISCOVERs.
#
# The address is on the relay-side network, because that is the link the
# subscriber this circuit-id names would be on. It sits outside the pool the
# subnet plugin serves for the same relay, so the two cannot be confused.
@CIRCUIT_ID@ @RELAY@.31 2h
